    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis wonderfully presented four/five-bedroom family home offers spacious and highly flexible living accommodation in a convenient location on the Tralee Road, just 2km from the town centre.The main residence comprises four bedrooms, three of which benefit from en-suite facilities, together with a comfortable living room, kitchen/dining room and family bathroom.A particularly attractive feature of the property is the separate annex accommodation. At ground floor level, the annex comprises a living room and kitchenette, while the first floor provides a fifth bedroom and shower room. This versatile space offers a variety of options and would be ideal as independent living accommodation for a family member. Alternatively, it could provide an excellent home office, gym, playroom or additional living space, depending on the purchaser's requirements.The annex may also offer the potential to avail of the Rent-a-Room Relief.The property is presented in walk-in condition throughout, offering prospective purchasers a home that is ready to enjoy from the outset. Its combination of generous accommodation, excellent flexibility and convenient location makes this an ideal family home.\nGARDEN\nSouth West facing enclosed lawn to rear.Large enclosed south west facing patio to rear benefitting from evening sunshine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHOUSE - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 2.8 x 3.9\n\n\nLinen Closet/Hotpress - \n\n\nSittingroom - 5.6 x 4.5\nCarpeted, stove\n\nKitchen/Diningroom - 6.3 x 3.5\nHand painted fitted kitchen, double oven, dishwasher, hob Door to patio and garden\n\nBathroom - 3.5 x 1.8\nBath, wc, wash hand basin, paneled\n\nBedroom One - 3.4 x 3\n\n\nBedroom Two - 3.6 x 2.8\n\n\nEn suite - 2.4 x 0.8\nElectric shower, wc, wash hand basin\n\nBedroom Three - 3.85 x 4.6\nMaple floor\n\nEn-Suite - 2.8 x 1.8\nElectric shower, wc, wash hand basin\n\nBedroom Four (master) - 5 x 3.9\nSliderobes with built in shoe storage under, walnut floor\n\nEn-Suite - 1.7 x 1.8\nPower shower, wc, wash hand basin\n\nCONNECTED SELF CONTAINED APARTMENT - \n\n\nGround floor: - \n\n\nHall - 2.4 x 1.6\n\n\nKitchen/Utility - 3.2 x 3.5\nCream fitted storage units\n\nLiving Room - 4.5 x 3.6\nSliding door to outside\n\nFirst floor: - \n\n\nBedroom five/home office - 6.25 x 2.8\nBuilt in storage\n\nShower room - 1.6 x 1.55\nShower, wc, wash hand basin, fully fitted.\n\nAREA - \n\n\nHOUSE - 135 sq.m.\n\n\nAPARTMENT - 53 sq. m.\n\n\nTOTAL - 188 sq. m./2,023 sq. ft.\n\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nSteel tec storage shed - \nLighting and sockets.\n\n"
